{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA-NeMo/RL/pulls/2590","id":3758172510,"node_id":"PR_kwDOOJjv8s7gASle","html_url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA-NeMo/RL/pull/2590","diff_url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA-NeMo/RL/pull/2590.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/NVIDIA-NeMo/RL/pull/2590.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA-NeMo/RL/issues/2590","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA-NeMo/RL/pulls/2590/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA-NeMo/RL/pulls/2590/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA-NeMo/RL/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA-NeMo/RL/issues/2590/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA-NeMo/RL/statuses/1e7bb718d796d56b7079ebe849dabaebd82dd835","number":2590,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat: add router replay (R3) support","user":{"login":"zyzhou5","id":267781195,"node_id":"U_kgDOD_YESw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/267781195?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyzhou5","html_url":"https://github.com/zyzhou5","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyzhou5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyzhou5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyzhou5/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyzhou5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyzhou5/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyzhou5/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyzhou5/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyzhou5/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyzhou5/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"# What does this PR do ?\r\n\r\nAdds Router Replay (R3) support for Megatron MoE policy training with vLLM\r\nrollout generation.\r\n\r\nR3 records MoE router choices from rollout generation and replays them during\r\nMegatron prev-logprob and train forward passes. This keeps generated tokens on\r\nthe same expert routes used during rollout and avoids train-vs-rollout\r\nexpert-routing mismatch that is unrelated to the policy update.\r\n\r\nThe current NeMo RL integration is wired and tested for vLLM rollout\r\ngeneration. Other inference/generation backends are not wired into this path\r\nand have not been tested with Router Replay.\r\n\r\n# Configuration\r\n\r\n```yaml\r\npolicy:\r\n  router_replay:\r\n    enabled: true\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhen Router Replay is enabled, NeMo RL configures vLLM rollout generation with\r\n`enable_return_routed_experts=True` and carries the returned routes through the\r\nnormal rollout and policy data path as `routed_experts`.\r\n\r\nExample recipe:\r\n`examples/configs/recipes/llm/grpo-qwen3-30ba3b-8n8g-megatron-cp2-r3.yaml`\r\n\r\n# Documentation\r\n\r\nSee [docs/guides/router-replay.md](docs/guides/router-replay.md) for\r\nconfiguration details, trace debugging, fallback behavior, and validation notes.\r\n\r\n# Validation\r\n\r\nEffectiveness validation report:\r\n<https://api.wandb.ai/links/nvidia-nemo-fw-public/m4onwlx8>\r\n","labels":[{"id":8303135938,"node_id":"LA_kwDOOJjv8s8AAAAB7ufMwg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA-NeMo/RL/labels/Documentation","name":"Documentation","description":"Improvements or additions to documentation","color":"0075ca","default":false},{"id":8464339795,"node_id":"LA_kwDOOJjv8s8AAAAB-IOTUw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA-NeMo/RL/labels/CI:L1","name":"CI:L1","description":"Run doctests, unit tests, and functional tests","color":"bfd4f2","default":false},{"id":11306978444,"node_id":"LA_kwDOOJjv8s8AAAACofLMjA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NVIDIA-NeMo/RL/labels/Ready%20for%20QA","name":"Ready for QA","description":"","color":"15289c","default":false}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-05-27T21:45:49Z","updated_